Text:
A skeleton of the standard library: only the grammar that the designs of this folder use.
The text of an Info file is the text that .str gives for an Info, and Infos.fromStr reads that text back.
Infos.msg(""), Infos.list() and Infos.map() are one Info, the empty Info.

Grammar:
Info ::= Infos.msg(Str) | Infos.list(Info1 .. Infon) | Infos.map(Str1, Info1 .. Strn, Infon)
